; An account word beancount's lexer rejects is an invalid token, which drops
; the directive it is in, a transaction it is posted to or written in as a
; metadata value included.
2020-01-01 open Assets:bank
2020-01-01 open Assets:Ok
2020-01-02 note Assets:bank "x"

2020-01-03 * "posting"
  Assets:Ok     1 USD
  Assets:bank  -1 USD

2020-01-04 * "metadata"
  ref: Assets:bank
  Assets:Ok   1 USD
  Assets:Ok  -1 USD

2020-01-05 balance Assets:Ok 0 USD
